Reference Package Academic and Research Use Notice

The paired *Clostridioides difficile* seven-locus MLST reference package
(`mlst-cdifficile-20260806`) contains curated 3,501-bp concatenated reference
alignments, maximum-likelihood Newick reference trees, and clade metadata
derived from public PubMLST and EnteroBase sequence records by César Rodríguez
(Universidad de Costa Rica).

Permission is granted to use, copy, and redistribute this reference package for
academic, research, and public-health surveillance purposes, provided that
attribution to the original public sequence databases (PubMLST and EnteroBase)
and to the accompanying TreeTip Placer publication is maintained.
